-- The population of New Frontiers.
--
-- The switch put 105 keeps into region 163 and left them standing in an empty
-- world: zero mobs, nothing to fight, nothing to kill on the way to a keep.
-- Every frontier creature on this server still lived in the OLD frontier
-- zones, which is why the place looked untouched from the inside.
--
-- 8,353 mobs across the fifteen New Frontiers zones, 771 distinct creatures,
-- taken from the public database dump. Class types and brains are all stock
-- core ones, and 1,069 of the 1,073 NPC templates they reference are already
-- loaded, so this is a straight import rather than a translation.
--
-- Additive: region 163 held nothing before this. To undo it, and only it:
--     DELETE FROM mob WHERE Region = 163;

